i diversi, ma non troppo..."},{"language":"en-US","title":"My Brother Is an Only Child","overview":"Accio and Manrico are siblings from a working-class family in 1960s Italy: older Manrico is handsome, charismatic, and loved by all, while younger Accio is sulky, hot-headed, and treats life as a battleground — much to his parents' chagrin. After the former is drawn into left-wing politics, Accio joins the fascists out of spite, but his flimsy beliefs are put to test when he falls for Manrico's like-minded girlfriend.","tagline":"Sometimes the things we fight about are what brings us closest together."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8IFX3Y9pnFAChoaHN1Qhr6YqhdV.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wYA0JQkcveqKpc3dC0TOTpKdanG.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":9789,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8IFX3Y9pnFAChoaHN1Qhr6YqhdV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8IFX3Y9pnFAChoaHN1Qhr6YqhdV.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1201},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8IFX3Y9pnFAChoaHN1Qhr6YqhdV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8IFX3Y9pnFAChoaHN1Qhr6YqhdV.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1201},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rPQfm8Gil76vJgtGDw7V1CW4RbO.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rPQfm8Gil76vJgtGDw7V1CW4RbO.jpg","language":"it","width":1920,"height":2560},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bM64QWCL4VuzSPc0ctEl0yrEgUw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bM64QWCL4VuzSPc0ctEl0yrEgUw.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f7um13aZVUArrCnsr7FAJG2oxKc.jpg","previewUrl"